# Travel Designer Platform — QA Automation Suite

This repository contains an automated test suite designed as a bonus technical assignment for the **Travel Designer** travel configuration platform. It complements the manual test documentation by covering critical End-to-End (E2E) UI flows and core integration API endpoints.

## 🚀 Tech Stack

*   **Language:** Python 3.11+ [2026 Baseline]
*   **Test Runner:** Pytest
*   **Automation Library:** Playwright (Python implementation for fast, isolated, and reliable browser automation)
*   **Design Pattern:** Page Object Model (POM)

---

